# API (Vercel Serverless)

- All routes and helpers needed at runtime live **inline** in `api/index.ts`
- Shared types: `import type { ... } from "../shared/api"` only
- Do **not** `import` runtime modules from `../shared/` (breaks Vercel)
- Update `api/swagger.yaml` when endpoints change
- Dev: single port **8080** for frontend + backend (Express on 8081, Vite proxies `/api`)
- Only add endpoints when needed (secrets, DB, server-only logic)
- Keep TypeScript types consistent across `app/`, `api/index.ts`, and `shared/`
- Return `{ error: string }` with correct status (400/402/403/404/409) — use friendly messages, not driver errors
- Map duplicate and foreign-key failures to friendly responses. Never leak raw TiDB messages
- **Tests required:** every new/changed route gets `api/**/*.test.ts` coverage (happy + edges). Shared helpers: `testDbCleanup.ts`, `testHarness.ts`. See `api-testing.mdc`
